// c/hello_world's wire type -- byte-identical to zig/hello_world/idl/hello_world.idl.
// See docs/design/hello-world-reference-app.md at the repo root for the
// full spec. Deliberately keyless: per DDS 1.4 2.2.2.1, "If no key is
// provided, the data set associated with the Topic is restricted to a
// single instance" -- a keyless Topic is fully spec-legitimate, and zidl's
// --generate-zzdds-wrappers (C backend) generates DataWriter/DataReader for
// it (see zidl/src/backend/c.zig's isZzddsTopicStructC and emitStructFns'
// --generate-zzdds-wrappers branch).
@appendable
struct HelloWorld {
    int32 count;
    string<256> message;
};
